Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alice, Integrity Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Synthesis 30!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Proxy of the Three\NGoddesses, who protect this realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Priestess of Light,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and whoever dares defy me shall\Nknow the fury of my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alicia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time her soul will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I have the light cube that\Nholds her Flux light in my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to savor every last bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Subjects!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.70,0:00:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are heading south.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pugilists in the lead, then Dark\NKnights, then the Supply Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Knight is the Priestess of Light\Nand she is to be captured unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only one.
