62 319 l 966 319 966 321 962 321 m 767 402 l 771 402 771 404 767 404 m 713 348 l 715 348 715 350 713 350 m 574 321 l 578 321 578 323 574 323 m 1228 317 l 1230 317 1230 319 1228 319 m 736 323 l 738 323 738 325 736 325 m 725 274 l 727 274 727 276 725 276 m 1462 250 l 1464 250 1464 252 1462 252 m 1443 400 l 1445 400 1445 402 1443 402 m 1153 373 l 1155 373 1155 375 1153 375 m 1296 252 l 1298 252 1298 254 1296 254 m 680 334 l 684 334 684 336 680 336 m 946 320 l 950 320 950 322 946 322 m 562 381 l 566 381 566 383 562 383 m 933 394 l 935 394 935 396 933 396 m 469 387 l 471 387 471 389 469 389 m 581 412 l 585 412 585 414 581 414 m 620 417 l 622 417 622 419 620 419 m 1214 331 l 1216 331 1216 333 1214 333 m 790 290 l 792 290 792 292 790 292 m 1174 242 l 1176 242 1176 244 1174 244 m 862 418 l 866 418 866 420 862 420 m 1172 348 l 1176 348 1176 350 1172 350 m 760 375 l 764 375 764 377 760 377 m 1146 379 l 1150 379 1150 381 1146 381 m 1173 344 l 1177 344 1177 346 1173 346 m 647 361 l 651 361 651 363 647 363 m 1352 403 l 1354 403 1354 405 1352 405 m 965 297 l 967 297 967 299 965 299 m 1096 258 l 1100 258 1100 260 1096 260 m 591 274 l 595 274 595 276 591 276 m 1026 247 l 1028 247 1028 249 1026 249 m 1406 243 l 1410 243 1410 245 1406 245 m 1153 398 l 1155 398 1155 400 1153 400 m 1170 385 l 1174 385 1174 387 1170 387 m 433 302 l 435 302 435 304 433 304 m 860 325 l 862 325 862 327 860 327 m 1059 344 l 1063 344 1063 346 1059 346 m 1250 359 l 1252 359 1252 361 1250 361 m 807 254 l 811 254 811 256 807 256 m 1312 362 l 1316 362 1316 364 1312 364 m 976 358 l 980 358 980 360 976 360 m 746 403 l 750 403 750 405 746 405 m 1359 243 l 1361 243 1361 245 1359 245 m 1477 258 l 1481 258 1481 260 1477 260 m 976 342 l 980 342 980 344 976 344 m 590 271 l 594 271 594 273 590 273 m 1341 394 l 1345 394 1345 396 1341 396 m 455 253 l 457 253 457 255 455 255 m 941 307 l 943 307 943 309 941 309 m 1386 253 l 1388 253 1388 255 1386 255 m 1286 386 l 1290 386 1290 388 1286 388 m 573 393 l 577 393 577 395 573 395 m 1348 266 l 1352 266 1352 268 1348 268 m 1040 337 l 1044 337 1044 339 1040 339 m 1065 269 l 1069 269 1069 271 1065 271
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan's working a little too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vector's got his whole\Narmy coming after you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with you,\Nno doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be thankful he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is much better than\Nbeing ignored entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's talk about strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking me and\Nthe troops keep leading
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them south and slowly\Nchip away at their ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like the best approach. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have already wiped out\Nhalf of their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves their main force,\Nthe Dark Knights and Pugilists.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chasing us will wear them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we can defeat Emperor Vecta,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have hope the remaining people of\Nthis land will be open to a truce. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good hope to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem is, who's going to be in\Ncharge here when Vecta's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that punk Shasta\Nwas still alive then it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is true the general of\Nthe dark knights is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah I didn't see him or\Nhis number two out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he would have been our\Nbest shot to reason with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finished my reconnaissance\Nsir the shrubland
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,south of here should work for our ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for checking it out, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the units and get\Nthem ready to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dragon of yours\Nmust be exhausted by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure it gets food and\Nwater before we go. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of me's glad there won't\Nbe any more synthesis rituals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, having your\Nmemory and life stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's a horrible price\Nto pay to be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,part of me is also kind of\Nsad if we won't be seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any more young 'uns like\NRenly joining the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, stolen memories and\Nlives do not make a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of no such rule, Uncle. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:05:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we are all gone, our\Nsouls, our will, our purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they remain to inspire\Nthose we leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn pugilists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be a handful for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hit them with your bare\Nfists, they'll happily take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you come at them with a\Nsword, they refuse to get cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, the more training they go through,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more they think a sword's\Nnothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So watch out when you fight them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they can will their skin to get\Nhard, and they can deflect any blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to keep them busy, till the\Nothers are in position for the ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall go and face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to fight one of them\Nsuper-strong Integrity Knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.89,0:06:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am here to keep you\Nfrom advancing further.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the looks of you, you couldn't\Nstop a kid from getting by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can do is cast arts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not skilled in formal arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go kick her ass, Yote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm way more than you\Ncan handle, you beanpole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now shut up and draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll break you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you prefer\Nkeeping to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do people scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps, your urge to\Nslice them scares you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see in your eyes that it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had your way, you'd\Nslice up everything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel like you're cursed\Nwith a drive for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to\Nfeel ashamed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I can help you\Nuse it to your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your last reconnaissance\Nmission into the Dark Territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you brought this flower back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It absorbed massive amounts of the spatial\Nresources generated on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will turn it into your divine object,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sword with the highest priority\Nlevel that can cut through anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this sword, you shall wield a manifestation\Nof the curse carved into your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it and serve me with\Nyour murderous impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The curse you were born\Nwith now has a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice and hack and slash away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at the end of your blood-smeared path,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will find the key\Nto breaking your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a savage fighting\Nstyle and yet, as violent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as her attacks are I do\Nnot detect any hostility or
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any emotion for that\Nmatter, I've known her for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:10:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than a hundred years\Nand I still have no idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what goes on in her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about her,\Nshe can handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we should go before\Nthe main force catches up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to make sure\Neveryone's ready and waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the units are in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Commander Bercouli, the\Npugilists are vulnerable to sacred arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The planes might not have\Nenough spatial resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here, there's at\Nleast some vegetation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the priests should have enough\Nsacred power to launch an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it'll cause confusion, and\Nwe can use our dragons to burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the supply corps somewhere safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're standing by to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're far enough back that they\Nwon't get caught in the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good. Thank you.
