Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.87,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HECEAEB&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(963.18,887.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}O{\alpha&HFF&\t(20,140,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(40,160,\alpha&H00&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(60,180,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(81,201,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(101,221,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(121,241,\alpha&H00&)}r {\alpha&HFF&\t(142,262,\alpha&H00&)}b{\alpha&HFF&\t(162,282,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(182,302,\alpha&H00&)}f{\alpha&HFF&\t(203,323,\alpha&H00&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(223,343,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(243,363,\alpha&H00&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(264,384,\alpha&H00&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(284,404,\alpha&H00&)}h{\alpha&HFF&\t(304,424,\alpha&H00&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(325,445,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(345,465,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(365,485,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(386,506,\alpha&H00&)}d {\alpha&HFF&\t(406,526,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(426,546,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(447,567,\alpha&H00&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(467,587,\alpha&H00&)}t {\alpha&HFF&\t(487,607,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(508,628,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(528,648,\alpha&H00&)}v{\alpha&HFF&\t(548,668,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(569,689,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(589,709,\alpha&H00&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(609,729,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(630,750,\alpha&H00&)}d
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting bored sitting\Naround giving orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's about we go outside\Nand have ourselves some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks, but you can\Ngo first if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pick a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, in those woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That better be where the action\Nis or I'm gonna be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you'll have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,P-King, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five down, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for this! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fists are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your armor's nothing but paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might look like a girl,\Nbut you're as hard as a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am older than you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all supposed to be\Nimmortal freaks or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to call you Granny instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you are also freakish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skin is so hard, I\Ncould barely cut into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal with it, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,folks like us need an edge against you\Nknights but with your demon powers and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You charged in and chopped up all my pe -
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You maimed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were holding back, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think we\Nare, training dummies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're taking pity on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you to death personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That all his putilists did was punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that your armor's gone, you're\Nlooking way more like a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, you don't got\Nnearly enough muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should eat and train more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woman, as should you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just now you became a bit softer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you calling soft?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just getting warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I am, you're\Ngonna see me at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me all you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then wipe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleepy look off your face already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust that will suffice. Come then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, you asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so fired up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never fought anyone like her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange how I allow\Nthis battle to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be this one's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems weak everywhere except his fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he displays a will worthy\Nof an Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could end this by cutting off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should, but I wonder if I\Ncan slice through that fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though she looks like\Nsome weak upper class lady
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the Human Empire, deep\Ndown she's the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh she's gonna overpower me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well if I'm gonna die\Nthis ain't a bad way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell did\Nyou do that for, Donpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of time, champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Main force is almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you go thinking you won this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not woman. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The main force is almost here\Nand we got you surrounded, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lousy dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least tell me your\Nname before you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for your information,\Nmy name is ShetaSynthesis12.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sup, baby doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you spot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mentor taught me to trust\Nmy senses, not my eyes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have I heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemies behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dozens of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they destroy our supplies,\Nwe will be immobilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those two girls and\NKirito are back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should send backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I do, the enemy\Nwill know about our ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or could they already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should send all of\Nthese troops back to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they figured we'd head\Nthis way after we broke through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they stuck some troops\Ndown here to meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the troops up and out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiddo, go and help the Supply Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here and hold off the pugilists.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say you'll hold them off. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are 5,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, don't worry. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddamn, I missed the rush of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A life hanging by the edge of my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This right here's why I can't\Nget enough of player killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Lady Stacia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret room's opening up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, you've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same hair, same face, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer queen of the\NKnights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning Flash
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.24,0:22:10.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.76,0:22:13.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.77,0:22:17.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.89,0:22:21.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFAFAFA&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.93,0:22:23.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.36,0:22:30.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H372317&}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sad that it's so sad I can't
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.78,0:22:35.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H342517&}So bright that they hurt to look at now
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.59,0:22:43.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H45443F&\t(5338,5963,\c&H635253&)}If I was capable of living life all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,live alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.79,0:22:51.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H23241A&}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want anyone to love you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a\Nsong. It's your scent.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.56,0:22:56.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H351405&\t(610,1903,\c&H5B3445&)}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your story
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.72,0:23:00.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H2C1428&}Your smell, the way you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still in my body.\NI'm still in my heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.75,0:23:08.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H5A3E4A&}Pieces of love still linger all over my body
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.44,0:23:17.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H3F2930&}My only wish, my only wish is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goal
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.62,0:23:25.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}May you, wherever you are now,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.46,0:23:26.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H674256&}Be crying too
Dialogue: 4,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFEFEFE&}Be crying too
